<!-- 글자 입력 대화상자 (댓글 수정 등). 확인이면 DialogResult = true 로 닫히고, Value 에 입력값이 들어 있다. -->
<Window x:Class="ShoppingMall.Client.PromptWindow"
        xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        FontSize="14"
        Width="420" SizeToContent="Height" ResizeMode="NoResize"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterOwner" ShowInTaskbar="False">
  <StackPanel Margin="20">
    <TextBlock x:Name="LabelText" Margin="0,0,0,8" />
    <TextBox x:Name="Input" />
    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,16,0,0">
      <!-- IsDefault: Enter 키 = 확인, IsCancel: Esc 키 = 취소 -->
      <Button Content="확인" IsDefault="True" Click="Ok_Click" />
      <Button Content="취소" IsCancel="True" Margin="8,0,0,0" />
    </StackPanel>
  </StackPanel>
</Window>
